// M10B export preset — clip_compact.
// Spec §"Player-facing behavior" bullet 2: smaller resolution + bitrate
// suitable for ≤25 MB Discord-base-tier attachments. 854×480 @ 30 fps
// H.264 + AAC + mp4 at 700 kbps video + 96 kbps audio yields a ~6 MB
// clip at 60 seconds; ~12 MB at 120 seconds; comfortably under the
// 25 MB Discord-free-tier attachment cap. This is also the preset the
// cf-app post-mission "Export Last Replay" CTA uses (m10b-4 will wire
// the CTA → preset). Deterministic encoder profile (single thread +
// locked 120-frame GOP + `-tune psnr`) is applied by
// cf_replay_export::ffmpeg_bridge::DeterministicEncoderProfile.
(
    name: "clip_compact",
    resolution: (
        width: 854,
        height: 480,
    ),
    fps: 30,
    codec: h264,
    audio_codec: "aac",
    target_bitrate_kbps: 700,
    container: mp4,
)
